[{"id":"ll-trigger","title":"插入16后，哪里第一次违反高度限制？","section":"avl","role":"content","body":"<div class=\"d017\"><p class=\"d17-lead\">按BST规则依次插入30、20、16；更新后从插入位置向上检查祖先高度。</p><div class=\"d17-cols\"><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>临时状态：30左侧更深</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"LL0的二叉树示意\"><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"145\" stroke=\"#718fab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"122\" y2=\"242\" stroke=\"#718fab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"50\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#d7eafb\" stroke=\"#165d92\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193e61\">30</text><circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"145\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7894aa\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"220\" y=\"153\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193e61\">20</text><circle cx=\"122\" cy=\"242\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7894aa\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"122\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193e61\">16</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">30的左子树高2，右侧高0。</p></div><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>在哪个祖先处首次失衡？</h3><div class=\"d17-steps\"><div class=\"d17-step\"><b>30、20时</b>30的BF=+1，合法</div><div class=\"d17-step\"><b>插入16后</b>20所在子树的高度升为2</div><div class=\"d17-step\"><b>检查30</b>BF(30)=+2，超过限制</div></div><p class=\"d17-note\">此时BST顺序仍成立，但AVL高度条件暂时不成立。</p></div></div></div>","goal":"从插入位置向上找到最低失衡祖先","activity":"树形、比较和BF对应","withheld_results":[]},{"id":"right-rotate","title":"为什么一次右旋既保序又恢复平衡？","section":"avl","role":"content","body":"<div class=\"d017\"><div class=\"d17-condensed\"><div class=\"d17-cols\"><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>右旋前：根30失衡</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"LL0的二叉树示意\"><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"145\" stroke=\"#718fab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"122\" y2=\"242\" stroke=\"#718fab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"50\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#d7eafb\" stroke=\"#165d92\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193e61\">30</text><circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"145\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7894aa\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"220\" y=\"153\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193e61\">20</text><circle cx=\"122\" cy=\"242\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7894aa\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"122\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193e61\">16</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">BF(30)=+2，高度3。</p></div><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>右旋后：局部根为20</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"LL1的二叉树示意\"><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"164\" y2=\"158\" stroke=\"#718fab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"158\" stroke=\"#718fab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"50\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#d7eafb\" stroke=\"#165d92\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193e61\">20</text><circle cx=\"164\" cy=\"158\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7894aa\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"164\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193e61\">16</text><circle cx=\"380\" cy=\"158\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7894aa\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"380\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193e61\">30</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">左右孩子16与30，高度2。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"d17-formula\">① 中序仍为 16 → 20 → 30　　② 三个结点 BF 都为 0</div></div>","goal":"理解LL右旋的链接变换并分别核验顺序与平衡","activity":"旋转前后结构对照","withheld_results":[]},{"id":"rotation-order","title":"中间子树B换了位置，为什么顺序不变？","section":"avl","role":"content","body":"<div class=\"d017\"><p class=\"d17-lead\">一般右旋需要保留整个子树A、B、C的关键字范围，并将中间子树B正确重接。</p><div class=\"d17-cols\"><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>结构约束（整棵子树）</h3><div class=\"d17-formula\">A &lt; y &lt; B &lt; z &lt; C</div><p class=\"d17-note\">旋转前 z 为局部根，y 是 z 的左孩子，B 是 y 的右子树。</p><p class=\"d17-note\">旋转后 y 为局部根，z 为 y 的右孩子，B 变为 z 的左子树。</p></div><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>对应的最小C11链接调整</h3><pre class=\"d17-code\"><code>Node *y = z-&gt;left;\nNode *middle = y-&gt;right;\ny-&gt;right = z;\nz-&gt;left = middle;\nfix(z); fix(y);\nreturn y;</code></pre><p class=\"d17-note\">调用者还要让旧父链接或根指针指向返回的新局部根y。</p></div></div></div>","goal":"解释中间子树重接仍保持BST顺序","activity":"子树范围与C11字段映射","withheld_results":[]},{"id":"lr-single-fails","title":"30、16、20：只对30右旋会怎样？","section":"avl","role":"exercise","body":"<div class=\"d017\"><div class=\"course-workspace d17-workspace\" data-course-component=\"task-workspace\"><div class=\"course-input\" data-task-input><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>原始30、16、20的临时失衡树</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"LR0的二叉树示意\"><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"215\" y2=\"145\" stroke=\"#718fab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"215\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"242\" stroke=\"#718fab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"50\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7894aa\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193e61\">30</text><circle cx=\"215\" cy=\"145\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7894aa\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"215\" y=\"153\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193e61\">16</text><circle cx=\"304\" cy=\"242\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7894aa\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"304\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193e61\">20</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">根30的左孩子16，而20是16的右孩子。</p></div></div><div class=\"course-task\"><div class=\"course-prompt\" data-task-prompt><div class=\"d17-question\">请先画出仅右旋30后的树，再判断它是否同时满足BST和AVL。</div></div><details class=\"course-answer\" data-task-answer><summary>核对答案与理由</summary><div class=\"course-solution\"><p>单独对30右旋后：新根16，右孩子30，30左孩子20。</p><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"LRbad的二叉树示意\"><line x1=\"215\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"325\" y2=\"146\" stroke=\"#718fab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"325\" y1=\"146\" x2=\"249\" y2=\"242\" stroke=\"#718fab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"215\" cy=\"50\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#d7eafb\" stroke=\"#165d92\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"215\" y=\"58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193e61\">16</text><circle cx=\"325\" cy=\"146\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7894aa\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"325\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193e61\">30</text><circle cx=\"249\" cy=\"242\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7894aa\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"249\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193e61\">20</text></svg><p>中序依然为16、20、30，BST顺序成立；但新根16的BF为−2，<b>仍然失衡</b>。</p></div></details></div></div></div>","goal":"借助反例理解单旋可能保序但不恢复平衡","activity":"先预测、后揭示结果","withheld_results":["仍然失衡"]}]